boucle_midi.mid :
	midi loop file to be use by boucle_midi script
boucle_midi:
	script starting qjackctl, hexter, amidi and connecting pmidi on hexter
usefull link :
	link on dx7 pages references 
sysex2ins :
	script converting raw bank to instruments list .ins
Table_sysex_dx7_20101120.ods :
	full spreedsheet of dx7 sysex 


